g through the approval level\" arm. Nothing tests the no-escalation arm.\n\n**The follow-up draft** in the verdict's `## Dispositions` lists those fixes and asks for the four returned rows to be re-sat. The seven approvals stand.\n\nAs before, the hook's `format` step was skipped because ruff isn't installed for its Python 3.12. I left the coordinator's `.requested` marker untracked."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7299,"cache_read_input_tokens":498228,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":7299},"output_tokens":739,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f031c6a5-ecf0-490f-9890-c7a8a87f92fc","uuid":"f16992de-75ff-4be5-a6ec-d3db787bb69d","timestamp":"2026-10-21T23:41:46.905Z","request_id":"req_011CgGGU4pb3mKASiFa74EZ7"}
